 -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 52, "seek": 11688, "start": 133.0, "end": 134.76, "text": " And when his family heard it,", "tokens": [51171, 400, 562, 702, 1605, 2198, 309, 11, 51259], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 53, "seek": 11688, "start": 134.88, "end": 136.24, "text": " they went out to seize him,", "tokens": [51265, 436, 1437, 484, 281, 33413, 796, 11, 51333], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 54, "seek": 11688, "start": 136.4, "end": 138.5, "text": " for they were saying, He is out of his mind.", "tokens": [51341, 337, 436, 645, 1566, 11, 634, 307, 484, 295, 702, 1575, 13, 51446], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 55, "seek": 11688, "start": 139.0, "end": 141.84, "text": " And the scribes who came down from Jerusalem were saying,", "tokens": [51471, 400, 264, 39435, 279, 567, 1361, 760, 490, 15393, 645, 1566, 11, 51613], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 56, "seek": 11688, "start": 142.3, "end": 144.3, "text": " He is possessed by Beelzebul,", "tokens": [51636, 634, 307, 29608, 538, 879, 338, 1381, 12176, 11, 51736], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 57, "seek": 11688, "start": 144.64, "end": 146.85999999999999, "text": " and by the prince of demons he casts out,", "tokens": [51753, 293, 538, 264, 16467, 295, 19733, 415, 41921, 484, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1906101957280585, "compression_ratio": 1.6779026217228465, "no_speech_prob": 3.8228536141104996e-05}, {"id": 58, "seek": 14688, "start": 146.92, "end": 147.44, "text": " the demons.", "tokens": [50367, 264, 19733, 13, 50393], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 59, "seek": 14688, "start": 148.26, "end": 149.68, "text": " And he called them to him,", "tokens": [50434, 400, 415, 1219, 552, 281, 796, 11, 50505], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 60, "seek": 14688, "start": 149.74, "end": 151.14, "text": " and said to them in parables,", "tokens": [50508, 293, 848, 281, 552, 294, 971, 2965, 11, 50578], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 61, "seek": 14688, "start": 151.85999999999999, "end": 154.1, "text": " How can Satan cast out Satan?", "tokens": [50614, 1012, 393, 16583, 4193, 484, 16583, 30, 50726], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 62, "seek": 14688, "start": 154.68, "end": 156.76, "text": " If a kingdom is divided against itself,", "tokens": [50755, 759, 257, 10231, 307, 6666, 1970, 2564, 11, 50859], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 63, "seek": 14688, "start": 157.04, "end": 158.6, "text": " that kingdom cannot stand.", "tokens": [50873, 300, 10231, 2644, 1463, 13, 50951], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 64, "seek": 14688, "start": 159.12, "end": 161.2, "text": " And if a house is divided against itself,", "tokens": [50977, 400, 498, 257, 1782, 307, 6666, 1970, 2564, 11, 51081], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 65, "seek": 14688, "start": 161.2, "end": 163.18, "text": " that house will not be able to stand.", "tokens": [51081, 300, 1782, 486, 406, 312, 1075, 281, 1463, 13, 51180], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 66, "seek": 14688, "start": 163.76, "end": 166.82, "text": " And if Satan has risen up against himself and is divided,", "tokens": [51209, 400, 498, 16583, 575, 28614, 493, 1970, 3647, 293, 307, 6666, 11, 51362], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 67, "seek": 14688, "start": 167.3, "end": 169.94, "text": " he cannot stand but is coming to an end.", "tokens": [51386, 415, 2644, 1463, 457, 307, 1348, 281, 364, 917, 13, 51518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 68, "seek": 14688, "start": 171.07999999999998, "end": 173.34, "text": " But no one can enter a strong man's house", "tokens": [51575, 583, 572, 472, 393, 3242, 257, 2068, 587, 311, 1782, 51688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 69, "seek": 14688, "start": 173.34, "end": 174.44, "text": " and plunder his goods", "tokens": [51688, 293, 499, 6617, 702, 10179, 51743], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 70, "seek": 14688, "start": 174.44, "end": 176.82, "text": " unless he first binds the strong man.", "tokens": [51743, 5969, 415, 700, 41515, 264, 2068, 587, 13, 51862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20638370513916016, "compression_ratio": 1.8661087866108788, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004691584617830813}, {"id": 71, "seek": 17688, "start": 176.88, "end": 179.18, "text": " Then indeed he may plunder his house.", "tokens": [50365, 1396, 6451, 415, 815, 499, 6617, 702, 1782, 13, 50480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 72, "seek": 17688, "start": 180.07999999999998, "end": 181.24, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [50525, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 50583], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 73, "seek": 17688, "start": 181.66, "end": 184.0, "text": " all sins will be forgiven the children of man,", "tokens": [50604, 439, 13815, 486, 312, 30391, 264, 2227, 295, 587, 11, 50721], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 74, "seek": 17688, "start": 184.22, "end": 185.98, "text": " and whatever blasphemies they utter.", "tokens": [50732, 293, 2035, 46409, 41245, 530, 436, 17567, 13, 50820], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 75, "seek": 17688, "start": 186.6, "end": 188.96, "text": " But whoever blasphemes against the Holy Spirit", "tokens": [50851, 583, 11387, 46409, 41245, 279, 1970, 264, 6295, 7218, 50969], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 76, "seek": 17688, "start": 188.96, "end": 190.07999999999998, "text": " never has forgiveness,", "tokens": [50969, 1128, 575, 18396, 11, 51025], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 77, "seek": 17688, "start": 190.74, "end": 192.78, "text": " but is guilty of an eternal sin.", "tokens": [51058, 457, 307, 12341, 295, 364, 14503, 3343, 13, 51160], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 78, "seek": 17688, "start": 193.64, "end": 194.9, "text": " For they were saying,", "tokens": [51203, 1171, 436, 645, 1566, 11, 51266], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 79, "seek": 17688, "start": 195.46, "end": 197.14, "text": " He has an unclean spirit.", "tokens": [51294, 634, 575, 364, 9153, 282, 3797, 13, 51378], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 80, "seek": 17688, "start": 197.84, "end": 199.66, "text": " And his mother and his brothers came,", "tokens": [51413, 400, 702, 2895, 293, 702, 8452, 1361, 11, 51504], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 81, "seek": 17688, "start": 199.92, "end": 202.68, "text": " and standing outside they sent to him and called him.", "tokens": [51517, 293, 4877, 2380, 436, 2279, 281, 796, 293, 1219, 796, 13, 51655], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 82, "seek": 17688, "start": 203.18, "end": 204.92, "text": " And a crowd was sitting around him,", "tokens": [51680, 400, 257, 6919, 390, 3798, 926, 796, 11, 51767], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 83, "seek": 17688, "start": 204.92, "end": 206.1, "text": " and they said to him,", "tokens": [51767, 293, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51826], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2128139105368787, "compression_ratio": 1.6870229007633588, "no_speech_prob": 0.002079815836623311}, {"id": 84, "seek": 20610, "start": 206.1, "end": 209.6, "text": " Your mother and your brothers are outside seeking you.", "tokens": [50365, 2260, 2895, 293, 428, 8452, 366, 2380, 11670, 291, 13, 50540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 85, "seek": 20610, "start": 210.1, "end": 211.14, "text": " And he answered them,", "tokens": [50565, 400, 415, 10103, 552, 11, 50617], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 86, "seek": 20610, "start": 211.79999999999998, "end": 213.79999999999998, "text": " Who are my mother and my brothers?", "tokens": [50650, 2102, 366, 452, 2895, 293, 452, 8452, 30, 50750], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 87, "seek": 20610, "start": 214.34, "end": 217.04, "text": " And looking about at those who sat around him,", "tokens": [50777, 400, 1237, 466, 412, 729, 567, 3227, 926, 796, 11, 50912], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 88, "seek": 20610, "start": 217.18, "end": 217.62, "text": " he said,", "tokens": [50919, 415, 848, 11, 50941], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 89, "seek": 20610, "start": 218.32, "end": 220.12, "text": " Here are my mother and my brothers.", "tokens": [50976, 1692, 366, 452, 2895, 293, 452, 8452, 13, 51066], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 90, "seek": 20610, "start": 220.66, "end": 222.32, "text": " For whoever does the will of God,", "tokens": [51093, 1171, 11387, 775, 264, 486, 295, 1265, 11, 51176], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}, {"id": 91, "seek": 20610, "start": 222.44, "end": 225.18, "text": " he is my brother and sister and mother.", "tokens": [51182, 415, 307, 452, 3708, 293, 4892, 293, 2895, 13, 51319], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2744465118799454, "compression_ratio": 1.7756410256410255, "no_speech_prob": 0.008167203515768051}], "language": "English"}